# Utter needs no environment variables or accounts.
#
# The optional Groq key (free at console.groq.com) is entered in the app and stored in the
# macOS Keychain, not in an env file.
#
# Development only (ignored in release builds):
# UTTER_TEST_WAV=/absolute/path/to/16k-speech.wav   # replay this file instead of the microphone (scripts/e2e/run.sh)
